/*
 * Declares the MapIteratorValue class.
 *
 * MapIteratorValue is the abstract ancestor of all operator values involved in
 * iterating over a map. These operators represent the various steps required to
 * traverse a map safely, even when entries are inserted or removed during
 * iteration.
 *
 * Ymir map iterators are dynamically allocated and remain valid across
 * structural modifications to the map. The `del` iterator operation does not
 * delete a map entry; it destroys the iterator object itself, releasing its
 * internal resources.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::map::iteration
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/map/iteration.yr
